#: desktop.cc:815
msgid ""
"Could not log out properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel sair axeitadamente.\n"
"Non se pode contactar co xestor de sesións. Pode forzar o apagado premendo  "
"Ctrl+Maiús+Supr. Lembre que a sesión actual non será gardada cun apagado "
"forzada."

